<Defs>
  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase">
    <defName>YR_SamokWall</defName>
    <label>사목 벽</label>
    <description>수확한 사목 촉수로 만든 건축물. 일반 건축물과 같은 기능을 사용합니다.</description>
    <thingClass>Building</thingClass>
    <category>Building</category>
    <noRightClickDraftAttack>true</noRightClickDraftAttack>
    <replaceTags>
      <li>Wall</li>
    </replaceTags>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Building/Linked/Wall</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Appearances</graphicClass>
      <linkType>CornerFiller</linkType>
      <linkFlags>
        <li>Wall</li>
        <li>Rock</li>
      </linkFlags>
    </graphicData>
    <uiIconPath>Things/Building/Linked/WallSmooth_MenuIcon</uiIconPath>
    <uiIconPathsStuff>
      <li>
        <appearance>Planks</appearance>
        <iconPath>Things/Building/Linked/WallPlanks_MenuIcon</iconPath>
      </li>
      <li>
        <appearance>Bricks</appearance>
        <iconPath>Things/Building/Linked/WallBricks_MenuIcon</iconPath>
      </li>
    </uiIconPathsStuff>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>300</MaxHitPoints>
      <WorkToBuild>135</WorkToBuild>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <MeditationFocusStrength>0.22</MeditationFocusStrength>
    </statBases>
    <costStuffCount>5</costStuffCount>
    <leaveResourcesWhenKilled>false</leaveResourcesWhenKilled>
    <altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer>
    <passability>Impassable</passability>
    <blockWind>true</blockWind>
    <castEdgeShadows>true</castEdgeShadows>
    <fillPercent>1</fillPercent>
    <coversFloor>true</coversFloor>
    <drawStyleCategory>Walls</drawStyleCategory>
    <tickerType>Never</tickerType>
    <rotatable>false</rotatable>
    <selectable>true</selectable>
    <neverMultiSelect>true</neverMultiSelect>
    <useStuffTerrainAffordance>true</useStuffTerrainAffordance>
    <terrainAffordanceNeeded>Heavy</terrainAffordanceNeeded>
    <holdsRoof>true</holdsRoof>
    <designationCategory>Structure</designationCategory>
    <uiOrder>2000</uiOrder>
    <staticSunShadowHeight>1.0</staticSunShadowHeight>
    <blockLight>true</blockLight>
    <canOverlapZones>false</canOverlapZones>
    <fertility>0</fertility>
    <stuffCategories Inherit="False">
      <li>YR_SamokMatter</li>
    </stuffCategories>
    <building>
      <paintable>true</paintable>
      <isInert>true</isInert>
      <isWall>true</isWall>
      <isPlaceOverableWall>true</isPlaceOverableWall>
      <ai_chillDestination>false</ai_chillDestination>
      <supportsWallAttachments>true</supportsWallAttachments>
      <isStuffableAirtight>true</isStuffableAirtight>
      <blueprintGraphicData>
        <texPath>Things/Building/Linked/Wall_Blueprint_Atlas</texPath>
      </blueprintGraphicData>
    </building>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_MeditationFocus">
        <statDef>MeditationFocusStrength</statDef>
        <focusTypes>
          <li>Minimal</li>
        </focusTypes>
      </li>
      <li Class="YR_RJW.CompProperties_SamokArchitectureOverlay">
        <texPath>Yuran/Things/Building/SamokArchitecture/WallGuideSurfaceV8</texPath>
        <drawScale>0.68</drawScale>
      </li>
    </comps>
    <damageMultipliers>
      <li>
        <damageDef>Bomb</damageDef>
        <multiplier>2</multiplier>
      </li>
      <li>
        <damageDef>Thump</damageDef>
        <multiplier>2</multiplier>
      </li>
    </damageMultipliers>
    <drawerType>MapMeshAndRealTime</drawerType>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="DoorBase">
    <defName>YR_SamokDoor</defName>
    <label>사목 문</label>
    <description>수확한 사목 촉수로 만든 건축물. 일반 건축물과 같은 기능을 사용합니다.</description>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToBuild>850</WorkToBuild>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yuran/Things/Building/SamokArchitecture/DoorOverlay</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <uiIconPath>Yuran/Things/Building/SamokArchitecture/DoorOverlay</uiIconPath>
    <costStuffCount>25</costStuffCount>
    <building>
      <isStuffableAirtight>true</isStuffableAirtight>
      <soundDoorOpenManual>YR_SamokDoorOpen</soundDoorOpenManual>
      <soundDoorOpenPowered>YR_SamokDoorOpen</soundDoorOpenPowered>
    </building>
    <comps>
      </comps>
    <stuffCategories Inherit="False">
      <li>YR_SamokMatter</li>
    </stuffCategories>
    <colorPerStuff>
      <li>
        <stuff>YR_SamokTentacleRaw</stuff>
        <color>(255,255,255)</color>
      </li>
    </colorPerStuff>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="BuildingBase">
    <defName>YR_SamokPillar</defName>
    <label>사목 기둥</label>
    <description>수확한 사목 촉수로 만든 건축물. 일반 건축물과 같은 기능을 사용합니다.</description>
    <designationCategory>Structure</designationCategory>
    <uiOrder>2040</uiOrder>
    <altitudeLayer>Building</altitudeLayer>
    <passability>PassThroughOnly</passability>
    <fillPercent>0.25</fillPercent>
    <pathCost>0</pathCost>
    <uiIconScale>1.2</uiIconScale>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>160</MaxHitPoints>
      <WorkToBuild>750</WorkToBuild>
      <Mass>10</Mass>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <Beauty>5</Beauty>
      <StyleDominance MayRequire="Ludeon.RimWorld.Ideology">10</StyleDominance>
    </statBases>
    <stuffCategories Inherit="False">
      <li>YR_SamokMatter</li>
    </stuffCategories>
    <costStuffCount>20</costStuffCount>
    <holdsRoof>true</holdsRoof>
    <canOverlapZones>false</canOverlapZones>
    <rotatable>false</rotatable>
    <fertility>0</fertility>
    <specialDisplayRadius>6.9</specialDisplayRadius>
    <building>
      <isInert>true</isInert>
      <ai_chillDestination>false</ai_chillDestination>
      <paintable>true</paintable>
    </building>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yuran/Things/Building/SamokArchitecture/Pillar</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_Single</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>(1.8,1.8)</drawSize>
    </graphicData>
    <comps>
      <li Class="CompProperties_Styleable" />
    </comps>
    <colorPerStuff>
      <li>
        <stuff>YR_SamokTentacleRaw</stuff>
        <color>(255,255,255)</color>
      </li>
    </colorPerStuff>
  </ThingDef>
  <ThingDef ParentName="BasicBedBase">
    <defName>YR_SamokSleepBed</defName>
    <label>사목 촉수 침대</label>
    <description>일반 침대처럼 잠을 자고 휴식하는 사목 침대. 잠든 동안에만 보호 덩굴이 부드럽게 감싸며, 깨어나거나 움직이면 즉시 사라집니다. 휴식 성능은 일반 침대와 같습니다.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Yuran/Things/Building/SamokArchitecture/Bed</texPath>
      <graphicClass>YR_RJW.Graphic_SamokSleepBedV8</graphicClass>
      <drawSize>(1,2)</drawSize>
      
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <MaxHitPoints>140</MaxHitPoints>
      <Beauty>1</Beauty>
      <WorkToBuild>800</WorkToBuild>
      <Mass>30</Mass>
      <BedRestEffectiveness>1</BedRestEffectiveness>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
    </statBases>
    <size>(1,2)</size>
    <costStuffCount>45</costStuffCount>
    <uiOrder>2010</uiOrder>
    <building>
      <paintable>true</paintable>
      <bed_showSleeperBody>True</bed_showSleeperBody>
    </building>
    <stuffCategories Inherit="False">
      <li>YR_SamokMatter</li>
    </stuffCategories>
    <comps>
      <li Class="YR_RJW.CompProperties_SamokSleepCocoon" />
    </comps>
    <drawerType>MapMeshAndRealTime</drawerType>
    <colorPerStuff>
      <li>
        <stuff>YR_SamokTentacleRaw</stuff>
        <color>(255,255,255)</color>
      </li>
    </colorPerStuff>
  </ThingDef>
